			"notes": "#### Fixes\n- Fix Enigma clone armour duplication\n- Fix issue where Witch of Ink that could kill invulnerable players\n- Fix issue with Anomaly checking for daytime in other dimensions\n- Fix issue where Broodmother could not climb webs\n\n#### Improvements\n- Improve Broodmother and Shifter origins\n- Improvements to finding spawn locations for specific structures/biomes/dimensions\n- Improve grammar and clarity of power descriptions\n\n#### Admin\n- Add support for 1.20.4 (_incompatible with Origins 1.13.0-alpha.4!_)\n- Update mod compatibility tags (thanks to AdalynBlack)\n- Add partially complete uk_ua and de_de translations (thanks to the translators)\n- Update other .lang files (thanks to the translators)"
		},
